{"text": "3. 5 × 4 = 20", "start": 1339, "end": 1352, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "This doesn't equal 24, so let's try another approach.", "start": 1354, "end": 1407, "label": "suggest"}
{"text": "How about (12 - 8) × (7 + 4)?", "start": 1408, "end": 1437, "label": "suggest"}
